<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">Our top minds eliminate workflow pain, implement new tech, and consolidate delivery.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a4cb645 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="a4cb645" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b234262 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b234262" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7d188be elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget-tablet_extra__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7d188be" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_tablet_extra&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Service delivery on your behalf</h3></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2f322d6 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile_extra__width-inherit elementor-drop-cap-yes elementor-drop-cap-view-default elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2f322d6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;drop_cap&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>We function as an external IT service delivery partner. We help you with general IT support, install new computers and servers, maintain your old systems, set up and configure your network. Here we are all IT savvy and have an IT interest that makes us stay up to date in the world of technology, it gives us a broad competence in IT that we can use to help you.</p><p>If you are stuck on how to handle any of the <strong>office products or encountered a general system problem</strong>, we are there to assist you from small problems to complex ones. Help can be done on-site or remotely. We deliver <strong>Field Services and Device Lifecycle Services</strong> on behalf of IT industry leaders everywhere.</p></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-83dd940 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="83dd940" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation_tablet_extra&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="image.default">
<img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI5NTAiIGhlaWdodD0iNTcwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgOTUwIDU3MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgc3R5bGU9ImZpbGw6I2NmZDRkYjtmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk6IDAuMTsiLz48L3N2Zz4=" decoding="async" width="950" height="570" data-src="https://cromstelit.com/storage/2024/01/home-bg1.webp" class="elementor-animation-float attachment-full size-full wp-image-708" alt="home-bg1" data-srcset="https://cromstelit.com/storage/2024/01/home-bg1.webp 950w, https://cromstelit.com/storage/2024/01/home-bg1-300x180.webp 300w, https://cromstelit.com/storage/2024/01/home-bg1-768x461.webp 768w, https://cromstelit.com/storage/2024/01/home-bg1-600x360.webp 600w" data-sizes="(max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px" loading="eager" title="Global IT Services 14"></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3722be9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="3722be9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b6d730a elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b6d730a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_tablet_extra&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our Purpose</h3></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d77a00a elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile_extra__width-inherit elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d77a00a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>As a global company, we are aware of our impact on the world and our responsibility. But our corporate social responsibility goes beyond marketing campaigns and limiting negative impacts. We are The Social Purpose IT Company, committed to create a positive impact.  Here we are all IT savvy and have an IT interest that makes us stay up to date in the world of technology, it gives us a broad competence in IT that we can use to help you.</p><p>If you are stuck on how to handle any of the Office products or encountered a general computer problem, we are there to guide and help you. From small problems to big ones. Help can be done on-site or online via TeamViewer.</p><p>We pride ourselves on being the ideal IT solutions partner for our clients. Our commitment to delivering exceptional service and innovative solutions ensures your business operates smoothly and efficiently. We focus on understanding your needs and customizing our approach to provide the best possible outcomes.</p><p>Furthermore, we believe in transforming technology into a strategic asset for your business. Here’s why we are your go-to IT solutions partner:</p></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2beaa23 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget-mobile_extra__width-inherit elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="2beaa23" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="image.default">
